                        <bindingDesc>
                            <binding contemporary="true">
                                <p>Contemporary parchment binding. <locus from="LCO" to="LCO" scheme="other"/>, stamped in black with traces of gold: <quote>Anno Christi M DC LXX IV</quote>; at the bottom: <quote>CATALOGVS BIBLIOTHECAE STREGNENSIS</quote>. Green ribbon remaining on <locus from="RCO" to="RCO" scheme="other"/>, remaining holes on <locus from="RCO" to="RCO" scheme="other"/> and <locus from="LCO" to="LCO" scheme="other"/>. <locus from="Spine" to="Spine" scheme="other"/>: four raised bands and endbands. A paper label with text in brown ink by a modern hand: <quote>1674</quote>.</p>
                                <decoNote type="tooling">
                                    <p><locus from="LCO" to="LCO" scheme="other"/> and <locus from="RCO" to="RCO" scheme="other"/>: Rectangular frame, flowers in the corners and a medallion in the centre. <locus from="Spine" to="Spine" scheme="other"/>: flowers.</p>
                                </decoNote>
                            </binding>
                        </bindingDesc>
