                                <title type="desc">Catalogue of Strängnäs Cathdedral Library</title>
                                <note>
                                    <p>The catalogue lists books under the following categories:</p>
                                    <p><locus from="1r" to="1v" scheme="folios"/> A. Biblia</p>
                                    <p><locus from="2r" to="2v" scheme="folios"/> B. Interpretes et Commentarii biblici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="3r" to="3r" scheme="folios"/> C. Concordantiae Biblicae</p>
                                    <p><locus from="3v" to="4v" scheme="folios"/> D. Patres</p>
                                    <p><locus from="5r" to="5v" scheme="folios"/> E. Acta Consiliorum et Synodorum</p>
                                    <p><locus from="6r" to="10r" scheme="folios"/> F. Loci communes</p>
                                    <p><locus from="10v" to="13v" scheme="folios"/> G. Polemici seu Authores controversiarum</p>
                                    <p><locus from="14r" to="21r" scheme="folios"/> H. Postillae</p>
                                    <p><locus from="21v" to="22r" scheme="folios"/> I. Philosophi</p>
                                    <p><locus from="22v" to="24r" scheme="folios"/> K Historici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="24v" to="24v" scheme="folios"/> L Chronographi</p>
                                    <p><locus from="25r" to="26v" scheme="folios"/> M. Poetici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="27r" to="28v" scheme="folios"/> N. Oratores et Epistolici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="29r" to="29v" scheme="folios"/> O. (Politici)</p>
                                    <p><locus from="30r" to="30r" scheme="folios"/> P. Medici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="30v" to="31v" scheme="folios"/> Q. Iuridici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="32r" to="32r" scheme="folios"/> R. Dialectici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="32v" to="34r" scheme="folios"/> S. Grammatici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="34v" to="35r" scheme="folios"/> T. Mathematici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="35v" to="36r" scheme="folios"/> V. Libri rituum ecclesiastici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="36v" to="40r" scheme="folios"/> X. Scholastici</p>
                                    <p><locus from="41r" to="46v" scheme="folios"/> Selectior Bibliotheca ex liberalitate Doctoris Johannis Matthiae (...) apposita</p>
